    slug: "24-hour-animal-control-services-leads",
    title: "24-Hour Animal Control Services Leads: A Guide for Operators",
    metaTitle: "24-Hour Animal Control Leads for Operators",
    excerpt: "How wildlife and nuisance animal control operators can source and convert leads for urgent, after-hours removal calls.",
    metaDescription: "A guide to 24-hour animal control services leads, covering urgent wildlife removal demand, realistic pricing, and what makes a lead worth taking.",
